        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Storefront Door Latch Installation Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis installation plate is used to install Adams Rite type <a href=\"/products/storefront-door-mortise-lock-deadbolt-body-th1101\"><b>Mortise  Deadbolts</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/sliding-door-mortise-lock-hookbolt-body-th1102\"><b>Mortise  Hookbolts</b></a> or  <a href=\"/products/storefront-door-mortise-lock-deadlatch-body-th1103\"><b>Mortise  Deadlatch</b></a>. Can be used for new installations or as replacement for damaged mounting tabs on existing aluminum store front doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DJO-TB-215_size.gif?v=1704354598\" width=\"580\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo TB-215 mounting tab size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo TB-215 Mounting Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Length: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: .090</li>\r\n<li>Offset: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/TB-215.pdf?v=1704262303\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo TB-215 Mounting Plate Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually. </b>\r\n</p>",
